        "answer": {
          "short": "In order: $-\\frac{16}{65},\\ -\\frac{8}{17},\\ -\\frac45,\\ -1,\\ -\\frac45,\\ 0,\\ \\frac45,\\ 1,\\ \\frac45,\\ \\frac{8}{17},\\ \\frac{16}{65}$.",
          "worked": "Substitute each listed value of $x$ into $y=\\frac{2x}{x^2+1}$.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}y(-8)&=\\frac{-16}{64+1}=-\\frac{16}{65}\\\\y(-4)&=\\frac{-8}{16+1}=-\\frac8{17}\\\\y(-2)&=\\frac{-4}{4+1}=-\\frac45\\\\y(-1)&=\\frac{-2}{1+1}=-1\\\\y(-0.5)&=\\frac{-1}{\\frac14+1}=-\\frac45\\\\y(0)&=0\\\\y(0.5)&=\\frac{1}{\\frac14+1}=\\frac45\\\\y(1)&=\\frac2{1+1}=1\\\\y(2)&=\\frac4{4+1}=\\frac45\\\\y(4)&=\\frac8{16+1}=\\frac8{17}\\\\y(8)&=\\frac{16}{64+1}=\\frac{16}{65}\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 0,
        "responseSpace": "scaffold"
      },
